1
00:00:01,180 --> 00:00:01,630
Hi!

2
00:00:01,580 --> 00:00:02,830
I'm Sofia!

3
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:05,310
And this is my totally...

4
00:00:05,129 --> 00:00:06,430
normal...

5
00:00:06,230 --> 00:00:07,470
morning routine.

6
00:00:09,256 --> 00:00:10,178
This is Gus.

7
00:00:10,195 --> 00:00:11,618
My best friend.

8
00:00:11,688 --> 00:00:14,178
He is a goose.

9
00:00:14,618 --> 00:00:15,538
Don't ask.

10
00:00:17,624 --> 00:00:19,507
Every day, I wake up at seven

11
00:00:19,337 --> 00:00:20,147
o'clock.

12
00:00:20,858 --> 00:00:21,935
In the fridge.

13
00:00:22,865 --> 00:00:23,295
Again.

14
00:00:23,694 --> 00:00:25,784
Wake up means...

15
00:00:25,614 --> 00:00:26,904
stop sleeping.

16
00:00:26,782 --> 00:00:28,504
Your eyes open!

17
00:00:31,791 --> 00:00:33,801
Then, I get up!

18
00:00:35,726 --> 00:00:37,236
...Slowly.

19
00:00:37,523 --> 00:00:39,293
Wake up is your eyes.

20
00:00:39,243 --> 00:00:40,733
Get up...

21
00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:41,773
is your body!

22
00:00:44,804 --> 00:00:46,579
Next, I brush my teeth.

23
00:00:47,340 --> 00:00:48,080
Hmm.

24
00:00:47,910 --> 00:00:50,960
This toothpaste tastes like...

25
00:00:51,074 --> 00:00:52,960
mayonnaise?!

26
00:00:54,448 --> 00:00:55,418
One tooth.

27
00:00:55,468 --> 00:00:57,418
Two teeth.

28
00:00:57,488 --> 00:00:59,098
Not tooths!

29
00:01:02,109 --> 00:01:03,279
I take a shower.

30
00:01:03,176 --> 00:01:04,719
Every morning!

31
00:01:07,961 --> 00:01:09,506
...Thank you, Gus.

32
00:01:09,682 --> 00:01:11,852
We say: take a shower.

33
00:01:11,802 --> 00:01:13,132
Not...

34
00:01:12,930 --> 00:01:15,052
make a shower!

35
00:01:17,936 --> 00:01:18,939
Quick quiz!

36
00:01:18,801 --> 00:01:21,339
What do I do after the shower?

37
00:01:21,324 --> 00:01:23,574
A: get dressed.

38
00:01:23,377 --> 00:01:25,574
Or B: make breakfast?

39
00:01:28,866 --> 00:01:29,223
A!

40
00:01:29,253 --> 00:01:30,743
I get dressed.

41
00:01:31,229 --> 00:01:31,943
Well...

42
00:01:31,733 --> 00:01:32,583
I try.

43
00:01:33,336 --> 00:01:34,591
Now I get dressed.

44
00:01:34,565 --> 00:01:35,791
Fast!

45
00:01:37,589 --> 00:01:38,059
Perfect.

46
00:01:38,129 --> 00:01:40,939
I look amazing.

47
00:01:41,667 --> 00:01:42,412
...Wait.

48
00:01:42,290 --> 00:01:44,492
Something is wrong.

49
00:01:46,291 --> 00:01:47,901
Get dressed means...

50
00:01:48,011 --> 00:01:50,301
put on your clothes.

51
00:01:50,371 --> 00:01:51,581
Correctly.

52
00:01:54,660 --> 00:01:56,228
Then I make breakfast.

53
00:01:56,165 --> 00:01:57,428
Toast!

54
00:01:59,286 --> 00:02:00,757
Breakfast is...

55
00:02:00,587 --> 00:02:01,797
on the ceiling.

56
00:02:03,196 --> 00:02:03,926
Remember!

57
00:02:03,772 --> 00:02:05,686
Make breakfast...

58
00:02:05,456 --> 00:02:06,566
but take a shower.

59
00:02:09,677 --> 00:02:12,427
I always drink coffee in the morning...

60
00:02:14,396 --> 00:02:14,816
Gus!

61
00:02:14,662 --> 00:02:17,296
That is MY coffee!

62
00:02:21,359 --> 00:02:21,897
Bag.

63
00:02:21,727 --> 00:02:22,537
Keys.

64
00:02:22,367 --> 00:02:23,097
Phone.

65
00:02:23,087 --> 00:02:24,137
Gus.

66
00:02:24,063 --> 00:02:25,097
Okay!

67
00:02:25,314 --> 00:02:27,745
At eight o'clock, I leave the house!

68
00:02:27,735 --> 00:02:29,825
I'm not late today!

69
00:02:29,916 --> 00:02:30,897
GUS: Sofia.

70
00:02:30,705 --> 00:02:32,349
GUS: It is Saturday.

71
00:02:32,773 --> 00:02:34,006
...It's Saturday?

72
00:02:36,091 --> 00:02:36,565
Okay.

73
00:02:36,507 --> 00:02:38,165
Good night.

74
00:02:39,104 --> 00:02:40,934
Let's repeat my morning.

75
00:02:40,754 --> 00:02:41,854
Say it with me!

76
00:02:41,955 --> 00:02:43,005
I wake up.

77
00:02:45,300 --> 00:02:46,910
I get up.

78
00:02:48,411 --> 00:02:49,701
I brush my teeth.

79
00:02:51,282 --> 00:02:52,492
I take a shower.

80
00:02:53,675 --> 00:02:54,805
I get dressed.

81
00:02:56,864 --> 00:02:58,314
I make breakfast.

82
00:02:59,891 --> 00:03:01,101
I drink coffee.

83
00:03:02,584 --> 00:03:03,954
I leave the house.

84
00:03:05,429 --> 00:03:06,943
What do YOU do first in the

85
00:03:06,753 --> 00:03:07,823
morning?

86
00:03:07,640 --> 00:03:09,263
Write it in the comments!

87
00:03:10,375 --> 00:03:11,293
See you next time.

88
00:03:11,343 --> 00:03:12,573
Bye!
